WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:13,490
Do you have any objections or comments on the treatments proposed for me at the Immunotherapy

00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:15,090
Institute in Tijuana?

00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:22,530
So this person sent me a proposal from this Mexico cancer clinic in Tijuana, what they

00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,690
want to do for her.

00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:29,810
No, I think it looks great and if you feel led to go down there and do that, there's a lot

00:00:29,810 --> 00:00:35,130
of different, you know, semi-invasive therapies that could be really great.

00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:41,210
So I looked over it early this morning and I thought it was a great bit.

00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:49,210
So do I think for you specifically, is it necessary where you're at right now?

00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:55,170
No, but I mean, again, if you feel led to do that, then by all means to do that, I don't

00:00:55,170 --> 00:01:02,290
know if you made the step to talk to the surgeon yet, if you had that appointment, whether

00:01:02,290 --> 00:01:06,450
that, how that went, whether they're going to do a lump back to me, or they're still

00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:10,610
pushing you for a mastectomy, I don't know.

00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:19,250
So if you're planning on doing the Tijuana visit prior to that, or you're going to go do

00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:29,220
the surgery, do the lump back to me, or are they pushing you for a mastectomy, I don't know.

00:01:29,220 --> 00:01:34,820
But I did like their proposal and looked great.

00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:38,180
Do I think you particularly, I need to do that?

00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:42,980
No, but if you feel led to that, I don't see anything, any problem with that whatsoever.

